OpenDungeons_Version:0.7.1  # The version of OpenDungeons which created this file (for compatibility reasons).

[Info]
Name	Lanternreach
Description	A far reach of small lantern caves linked by narrow paths, a canyon creek and a few spans. Wander from hall to hall, claim what you find and make a home of it. Build as you like; nothing here ends the game.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
Sandbox	1
SandboxRealm	Lanternreach
SandboxTarget	20000
SandboxBonus	rooms	8	4000	-	Take over or build eight rooms
SandboxBonus	rooms	12	4000	-	Own twelve rooms
SandboxNext	skirmish/Splitstone.level
[/Info]

