[Trigger]
Name	hello
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Lanternreach, master. Small halls lie everywhere in these hills, each in a cave of its own. Follow the paths from hall to hall and see what is left in them.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	north
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	NorthHall
Action	message	1	A burial room nobody has sealed. Claim it and the dead will serve the living.
Action	gold	1	300
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	casino
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Casino
Action	message	1	A gaming hall, still warm. Your creatures will spend their wages here once you claim it.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	arena
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Library
Action	message	1	A small fighting pit lies in the north-west. Creatures that fight here grow stronger.
Action	gold	1	300
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	canyon
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Canyon
Action	message	1	A creek runs through a canyon here. Wooden spans cross it where the old paths did.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	temple
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	TempleHall
Action	message	1	An old temple stands in this cave. Claim it and your creatures will pray in it.
Action	gold	1	300
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	prisons
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Prisons
Action	message	1	A cell block and its keepers have long gone. Claim the cells and you can hold what you capture.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	deeps
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Deeps
Action	message	1	A second portal stands in the deeps. Travellers will come through the south-west hall, so watch the long paths.
Action	gold	1	300
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	libraryWell
